[00:05.000 – 00:10.000] She spoons ribs onto a fresh plate. Off-frame a small boy's voice, bright and insistent, calls out: <d>[Chinese] 阿姨，还要！</d> She laughs, shakes her head at the empty plate on the counter, and spoons out more without hesitation.
[00:10.000 – 00:15.000] She carries the plate out of the kitchen toward the sound of the voice. The camera lingers on the counter: the rice cooker still working, the used plate, and {SP} lying empty beside the pot — one packet, one pot, one plate, and a hob that was never lit.

overall_soundscape:
A rice cooker hissing softly, steam, a lid being set down, a child's bright voice in Chinese off-frame, a woman's laugh, kitchen room tone.

non_diegetic_music:
Warm, plain strings and guitar together — the theme at its most settled.""",
